12:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-5 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"常见问题"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","details","哪个 Etsy 费用计算器最准确？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"哪个 Etsy 费用计算器最准确？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"准确性取决于计算器是否使用当前的 Etsy 费率表并处理完整的费用栈。ToolOrbit Etsy 利润计算器使用公开记录的美国费率。如需最权威的数字，请与你的 Etsy 收款账户账单交叉核对。任何计算器都不能替代你的实际账单。"}]]}],["$","details","免费的 Etsy 费用计算器可靠吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"免费的 Etsy 费用计算器可靠吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"免费计算器如果对其费用假设透明并在 Etsy 更改费率时及时更新，是可以可靠的。关键是验证：用几笔测试订单对照 Etsy 账单检查。如果计算器持续匹配账单，它对于估算就是可靠的。如果不匹配，换一个。"}]]}],["$","details","我需要付费的 Etsy 计算工具吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"我需要付费的 Etsy 计算工具吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"大多数卖家不需要付费计算器。免费的浏览器工具可以很好地处理逐笔费用估算和定价决策。付费工具在需要批量分析、历史追踪、竞争情报或集成 listing 优化时变得有价值。从免费工具开始，只有在它们无法满足特定需求时才升级。"}]]}],["$","details","这些计算器与 Etsy 自己的费用信息相比如何？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"这些计算器与 Etsy 自己的费用信息相比如何？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Etsy 官方费用页面告诉你费率。计算器工具将这些费率应用于你的具体数字，并用结构化的明细展示结果。它们是互补的：使用 Etsy 页面确认费率是最新的，使用计算器查看这些费率对你的实际订单有何影响。"}]]}],["$","details","我可以用这些计算器处理任何国家的 Etsy 店铺吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"我可以用这些计算器处理任何国家的 Etsy 店铺吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"核心费用计算（上架费、交易费、支付处理费）使用美国 Etsy 费率。监管费计算器增加了针对英国、法国、意大利、西班牙、土耳其、印度、越南和加拿大的国家特定费率。货币转换计算器处理跨境结算的 2.5% 费用。未覆盖地区的卖家应将其当地费率与计算器假设进行核对。"}]]}],["$","details","基于浏览器的计算器中我的销售数据安全吗？",{"className":"border-b border-slate-200 py-4 dark:border-slate-800","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"基于浏览器的计算器中我的销售数据安全吗？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"ToolOrbit 计算器在你的浏览器本地处理所有数据。你输入的数字不会传输到任何服务器。你可以通过打开浏览器 DevTools 切换到 Network 标签页来验证：计算期间不会有包含数据的网络请求发出。这种本地优先设计是有意的——财务数据应留在你的设备上，除非你主动选择分享。"}]]}]]}]]}]
13:["$","footer",null,{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-600","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","dzmm74",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}],"$undefined"]}],"由 ToolOrbit 编辑团队维护。本页面链接到实用工具和配套指南，帮助读者验证具体工作流，而不是依赖笼统说法。"]}],["$","$L1d",null,{"href":"/authors/toolorbit-editorial-team","className":"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300","children":["编辑团队资料"," ",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1q9fwt",{"d":"M15 3h6v6"}],["$","path","gplh6r",{"d":"M10 14 21 3"}],["$","path","a6xqqp",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]
